    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Category:</strong> Technology feat</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Agy 13.</p><p><strong>Summary:</strong> Build exceptionally small devices and optionally hide or disguise their purpose.</p><p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Gain +2 on Craft (technological device) checks to build Tiny, Diminutive, or Fine devices, and increase your Technological Limit by 2 for those projects. You may conceal such a device or disguise it as another object. Finding a concealed or disguised device requires a Spot check, while determining its function requires a Use Technological Device check; both DCs equal 10 + your ranks in Craft (technological device).</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> A tinker may select Small Device Knack as a bonus tinker feat.</p><p><strong>Tinker bonus feat:</strong> Yes</p><p><strong>Foundry and GM handling:</strong> Foundry records the feat but does not classify device size, apply the contextual construction modifiers, or generate concealment records. Record whether the device is hidden or disguised; the GM must resolve the Spot and Use Technological Device checks using the creator&#39;s Craft ranks, adjudicating any later rank change because the feat does not specify when that value is fixed.</p>"
    },
